<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 568.47, up 1280.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 296 to 215.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.03.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 18,061,870, compared with 23,573,870 Thursday.</p>
<p>	    (Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
